SUMMARY:[TEP] The Position Fix Webinar
LOCATION:https://meet.google.com/dse-gjui-jsw
DESCRIPTION:Join with Google Meet: https://meet.google.com/dse-gjui-jsw\n\nAttendees are entered to win a FREE Video-Based Rider Performance Analysis\, drawn in each session.\n\nWhy Your Position Keeps Slipping (and How to Fix It)\n\nAlmost every rider has a version of it. The collapsing side you can't seem to shake\, the swinging lower leg that shows up the second you get tired\, the bouncy sitting trot that never quite lets you settle. Most of us have our coaches repeat the same few cues lesson after lesson\, and no matter how hard we try\, we keep defaulting back to old habits!\n\nIn this session we'll break down the most common rider position faults and where they actually come from. Beyond the surface-level "just soften your hands" or "shoulders back" cues that never seem to click\, diving into the underlying strength\, mobility\, and motor control patterns that create the fault in the first place (and what to actually do to change them off the horse).\n\nYou'll learn how to identify your own position patterns\, why some corrections stick and others don't\, and how targeted off-horse strategies can produce bigger changes in your riding than another year of struggling to get them to click.
